{"id":"en_jinx-no-more-love-at-the-door","title":"Jinx No More, Love at the Door","titleEn":"Jinx No More, Love at the Door","description":"Leah has spent her life being treated as a curse. When she was diagnosed with cancer, her family turned their backs on her and left her to face it alone. To cover the cost of treatment, she took a job in a bar as a \"drink shield,\" absorbing other people's alcohol so they wouldn't have to. But the family's beloved adopted daughter set her up, and her own brother beat her for it. With nowhere left to turn, Leah tried to end her life, while her neighbor Noah... Those wanting to see how this story unfolds can follow it on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/jinx-no-more-love-at-the-door/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/jinx-no-more-love-at-the-door/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Counterattack","Growth","Scumbag-punishing","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dje6k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_jinx-no-more-love-at-the-door_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dje6k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_jinx-no-more-love-at-the-door_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dje6k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_jinx-no-more-love-at-the-door_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dje6k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_jinx-no-more-love-at-the-door_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (